  "body": "What happens: In a group of value fields, the user presses Enter in one field. Focus does not move to the next value field. The user presses Tab. Focus does not move between the input fields either.\n\nExpected: Enter commits the value and moves focus to the next value field in the group. Tab moves focus to the next field. Shift+Tab moves focus to the previous field.\n\nReported by the maintainer in chat. No page or operation is named yet. Check the operation property panel, the setup pages and the tool dialog.\n\nNotes for the fix:\n- The undo rule stays: a committed value goes through its command (`EditOperationParams` or the matching command).\n- Focus order is ephemeral UI state, so it needs no command.\n- A behaviour test asserts focus and commands, not positions or sizes (`crates/ui/AGENTS.md`).\n\nDone means: Enter in a value field commits it and focuses the next value field of the group. Tab and Shift+Tab move focus between fields. A test pins each case on at least the operation property panel.\n",
